    "content": "Certainly! Here is the corrected version of the draft with clarity and improved wording:\n\n---\n\n**Using the Supplied Local Kujo Docs, Write a Short 60-Word Explanation of Module Imports. Do Not Invent Syntax.**\n\nKujo supports the importation of file-based and binary modules to enhance the language's capabilities. The import system leverages mechanisms similar to npm for dynamically resolving modules. To learn more about module imports in Kujo, please refer to the [official documentation] for detailed information on importing files and binary modules.",
